  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Upgrading and improving health care infrastructure in Northern Province</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing the standard of health care in the Northern Province (Point Pedro, Kilinochchi, Mankulam, Vavunya) to bring it on par with the national average will improve the well-being of the 1.25 million inhabitants of the Northern province. It will also have the secondary benefit of increased productivity and employment due to better health outcomes.</narrative>
  </description>
